==Battleground==
*1 [[Hyppoh]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Hyppoh]] spawns after 11.33 seconds<sup>340f</sup>.
*1 [[Hyppoh]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*1 [[Imperator Sael]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*1 [[Imperator Sael]] spawns after 31.33 seconds<sup>940f</sup>.
*1 [[Imperator Sael]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Elder Sloth]] spawns as the boss.
**4 [[Scissoroo]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**2 [[Elizabeth the LVIth]]s spawn, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
**1 [[Bun Bun Symbiote]] spawns.

==Strategy==
This stage can be somewhat difficult, as the combination of Elder Sloth, Bun Bun Symbiote, and Elizabeth the LVIth can push rather hard together. However, none of them appear until the base is hit. This effectively allows the player to use the starting enemies for cash and stacking, as a combination of crowd-controllers and strong anti-Alien offense should withstand and crush even the combined forces of some of the toughest Unstarred Alien enemies. Also, if any Anti-Wave Cats can fit in a lineup to beat the regular Horrorpotamus stages, they can seriously help, though any units that can beat [[Super Hyppoh]] can generally provide the offenses needed here.

